DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
SUMMARY:Echoes of Valor
DESCRIPTION:A juried exhibition highlighting creative work by veterans\, active-duty service members\, military spouses\, military family members\, and artists whose work explores military life and service. Our hours are Friday 12-4 Saturday/Sunday 12-5. Other days are by appointment only.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/echoes-of-valor/26290/
