UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfrederickatnight22573-20261113@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261108T163636Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
SUMMARY:Frederick at Night
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the holiday season at Frederick at Night\, when Downtown Frederick glows with twinkling lights\, late-night shopping\, seasonal bites\, and festive fun! Bring your friends and family and explore all the ways to celebrate downtown. Here's what's happening: Holiday Lights: Stroll under a canopy of twinkling lights as they switch on for the season. Take a walk\, snap a few photos\, and soak up the glow. Late Night Shopping: Your favorite local businesses will be open late from 5PM to 8PM with holiday goodies\, special offers\, tastings\, giveaways\, and in-store events. Double Decker Bus Tour: Hop aboard a Maryland Double Decker for a festive ride and see the lights and sights of the season from a whole new perspective. Tickets: https://marylanddoubledeckers.com/downtown-frederick-at.../ Taste of the Season: Indulge in seasonal food and drinks as you shop your way around downtown. Try a new-to-you restaurant or revisit a favorite. Light Walk: Take a self-guided stroll past creative light installations around downtown. Find all locations at https://downtownfrederick.org/lightwalk/ See the full list of participating businesses and more details at https://downtownfrederick.org/frederickatnight/ Frederick at Night is presented by Moore Wealth. Stop by and say hello at 30 N Market St from 5 to 8PM!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-at-night/22573/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventguidedexhibittours25817-20261113@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261108T163636Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
SUMMARY:Guided Exhibit Tours
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Museum of Frederick County History through a guided tour. Join the staff and volunteers who curated our 2026 exhibits as they explore our various galleries. Each tour is a unique experience based on the interests of the group and what special things staff wants to highlight that week. Descriptions of each week's tour can be found on the Heritage Frederick website\, which includes accessibility notes. Tours are included with admission!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/guided-exhibit-tours/25817/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
