DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261114
SUMMARY:Purple Flo 70's Style Concert
DESCRIPTION:All the way from Baltimore!! Join us for Purple Flo Live in Concert for the 1st time at Rockwell Brewery. This is a show and a band that you definitely don’t want to miss! Friday 11/13/26 @ 8PM! Described as Hendrix Driven Classic Rock - This 70’s throwback show is going to light you up and bring you back! ALL OF YOUR FAVORITE HITS with none of the fluff! Put on that throwback gear\, grab your friends\, spread the word and get ready to Rock! EVERYONE\, young and old\, is going to have a blast! Get here early! NO COVER CHARGE! Loads of Fun! All Ages.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/purple-flo-70s-style-concert/26305/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgevent2026exhibitsatmuseumoffrederickcountyhistory24908-20261114@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261108T163636Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
SUMMARY:2026 Exhibits at Museum of Frederick County History
DESCRIPTION:Take a deep dive into various topics that have defined Frederick's history\, as we celebrate America's 250th anniversary and our County's role in the Revolution. Featuring brand new exhibits: Cultivating Independence: Frederick in the Revolution Witnessing Revolution All Saints Street: Avenue to the History of Frederick and Its African American Community Growing Gold: A History of Frederick’s Goldfish Industry And returning favorites: Etchison Connections Timeless Toys 24 E Church Street Decorative Arts See our all new and renovated exhibits\, March 7\,2026 through December 12\, 2026. Buy tickets here.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/2026-exhibits-at-museum-of-frederick-county-history/24908/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventcantpromisetomorrowlive26095-20261114@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261108T163636Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
SUMMARY:Can't Promise Tomorrow LIVE
DESCRIPTION:Back again to rock Rockwell! It's time for a Saturday Night Party!! And you don't want to miss out on this one! CAN'T PROMISE TOMORROW covers classic and party-rock favorites from the '80s and '90s\, all hits that you know and love. That includes '80s classics by Van Halen\, Journey\, Tom Petty\, The B-52s\, and Tears for Fears. Plus '90s faves from Alice in Chains\, Incubus\, Cake\, Bush\, Smashmouth\, and The Cranberries. Excited to be back on the Rockwell stage again\, CAN'T PROMISE TOMORROW has added plenty of new songs to their setlist since their last Rockwell show. Come on out to catch this hardworking local band\, support live music\, and enjoy some of Rockwell’s great brews\, food\, and cocktails. 100% of ticket sales goes directly to the band! Grab all of your best party friends and head to Rockwell early to get a spot near the dance floor!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/cant-promise-tomorrow-live/26095/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfrederickcitymarket11348-20261115@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261108T163636Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261116
SUMMARY:Frederick City Market
DESCRIPTION:The Frederick City Market is a local food and artisan market located in the historic district of Downtown Frederick\, Maryland. Join us on every Sunday from May through November. Parking is free on Sundays and there are usually plenty of spots on 7th Street and Market Street. You can park at Gravel and Grind (15 E 6th Street) and walk through the gap into the market lot.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-city-market/11348/
END:VEVENT
